        "original_id": "ac478f02-5177-5528-abed-406faa7f4b23",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Miami Dolphins, Kansas City Chiefs, New York Jets\n- People: Adam Gase, Andy Reid, John Dorsey\n- Roles: head coach, general manager\n- Events: 2016 NFL season, playoff berth, winning record, firing\n\nFacts:\n- The 2016 Miami Dolphins season was the franchise's 47th season in the National Football League and its 51st overall season.\n- The 2016 Miami Dolphins season was the first under head coach Adam Gase.\n- In Week 15 of the 2016 season, the Miami Dolphins clinched a winning record for the first time since 2008 with a win over the New York Jets.\n- The Miami Dolphins clinched a playoff berth the following week.\n- The 2016 Kansas City Chiefs season was the franchise's 47th season in the National Football League and its 57th overall season.\n- The 2016 Kansas City Chiefs season was the fourth under head coach Andy Reid.\n- The 2016 Kansas City Chiefs season was the fourth and final season under general manager John Dorsey.\n- John Dorsey was fired on June 22, 2017.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
